y to periods already invoiced.) Tj T* () Tj T* (5. Service availability. The Provider makes the Services available at least 99.5 percent) Tj T* (of each calendar month, measured at the Provider's network edge and excluding planned) Tj T* (maintenance announced at least five Business Days in advance. Planned maintenance takes) Tj T* (place outside the hours of 07:00 to 19:00 Central European Time on Business Days.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. Service credits. If availability in a month falls below the commitment, the Customer) Tj T* (receives a service credit of five percent of the monthly fee for each full half percentage) Tj T* (point below 99.5 percent, up to a maximum of twenty-five percent of the monthly fee.) Tj T* (Credits are deducted from the next invoice and are the Customer's only financial remedy) Tj T* (for unavailability. The Customer must claim a credit within thirty days after the end of) Tj T* (the month concerned.) Tj T* () Tj T* (7. Support. Support is available by email and through the support portal. Critical) Tj T* (incidents, meaning that the Services are unavailable or Customer Data is at risk, are) Tj T* (answered within one hour at any time of day. Other requests are answered within one) Tj T* (Business Day. The Customer names up to five support contacts who may open requests.) Tj T* () Tj T* (8. Customer Data. The Customer remains the owner of all Customer Data. The Provider) Tj T* (processes Customer Data only to provide the Services and as described in the data) Tj T* (processing terms annexed to this agreement. The Provider does not use Customer Data to) Tj ET
